  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>UCLan Cyprus is a branch campus of the University of Central Lancashire situated in Pyla, Larnaka. The campus opened in 2012 and is the only British private university in Cyprus. The University has students from over 100 countries and partnerships with 125 international institutions.</p><p>The best part about graduating from UCLan Cyprus is that you'll be awarded a double degree (two certificates) from the two Universities, UCLan UK and UCLan Cyprus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>UCLAN Cyprus has a thriving student life. You can join various student clubs and societies, such as the Food Society, Gaming Club, Law Society, Psychology Society, and many more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>UCLan’s accommodation, Student’s Nest, is located within the campus, with 171 en-suite rooms. It spans over 5,500 square meters and consists of 5 blocks with 49 flats.</p><p>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Sports</strong><br>There are various sports facilities at the University. The UCLan Cyprus Sports Lab uses the latest sports technologies, with tests, metrics and exams for athletes, delivered by accredited Sports and Exercise Scientists.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>The Engineering Labs at the University are equipped with workbenches and state-of-the-art equipment to support the Electrical &amp; Electronic Engineering programs. The Cognition Psychology Lab is home to a Child Observation Suite, equipped with video and audio recording equipment and an observation room.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
